<title>ITALY: SOCCER-VICENZA SIGN URUGUAYAN DEFENDER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VICENZA SIGN URUGUAYAN DEFENDER.</headline>
<dateline>VICENZA, Italy 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Cup holders Vicenza completed the signing on Thursday of Uruguayan Ricardo Canals from Spanish second division side Logrones.</p>
<p>Vicenza paid $1.8 million for the central defender, who signed a four year contract.</p>
<p>&quot;This is a great moment for me after the disappointment of relegation in Spain last season,&quot; he said. &quot;I'm very keen on playing in the Cup Winners' Cup next season.&quot;</p>
<p>Canals will be eligible to play in the Italian supercup, the traditional curtain-raiser to the serie A season, against champions Juventus on August 23.</p>
<p>Logrones finished bottom of the Spanish first division last season.</p>
</text>
